steps.explanation:
- $Q_{old} = P\tan(\arccos {{pf1}})$ = {{Q1|VAR}}
- $Q_{new} = P\tan(\arccos {{pf2}})$ = {{Q2|VAR}}
- The capacitor must absorb $Q_C = Q_{new} - Q_{old}$ = {{Q2-Q1|VAR}}
- $|Q_C| = \omega CV_{rms}^2 \Rightarrow C = \frac{ {{Q1-Q2}} }{2\pi\times{{f}}\times{{V}}^2}$ = {{(Q1-Q2)/(2*pi*f*V^2)|F}}
